    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13259" root="دهر" body-key="d">
    
      Q. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَهْوَرَهُ</span></b> , (S, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَهْوَرَةٌ</span>, (TA,)
<i>He collected it together, and threw it into a deep
place.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He pushed it,</i> namely, a wall,
<i>so that it fell.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دهوراللُّقَمَ</span> <i>He made the
mouthfuls large,</i> (S, A,) or <i>round,</i> (Az,) <i>and
gulped them down.</i> (Az, A.)

